<title>USA: Sioux City feeder cattle steady-up $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City feeder cattle steady-up $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers sold steady to $1.00 per cwt higher, compared to last Wednesday's auction, USDA said.  Trade was moderate on good demand. 67 percent over 600 lbs.</p>
